1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,800
Meet RTMI: a real-time match intelligence
control room.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:13,866
A deterministic football match becomes a live,
personalized broadcast with explainable AI review.

3
00:00:13,866 --> 00:00:18,200
Match events stream live over SignalR.

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:23,000
Start, pause, reset, or launch the repeatable
Demo Run.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,976
Stats, timeline, and momentum update as the
game unfolds.

6
00:00:27,976 --> 00:00:31,500
Choose Casual, Stats Nerd, Kid, or Tactician.

7
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,100
The same key moment can be narrated in a
different voice,

8
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:40,241
while match facts stay grounded in the
event feed.

9
00:00:40,241 --> 00:00:44,500
Every insight comes with receipts.

10
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,200
Open Why This to inspect evidence IDs and
trace them in the timeline.

11
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,463
Sources and confidence are visible; fallback
output is labeled.

12
00:00:53,463 --> 00:00:58,800
The analyst desk gathers tactics, stats, and
fan perspectives in parallel.

13
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:05,156
A verdict agent synthesizes those takes into
one evidence-backed conclusion.

14
00:01:05,156 --> 00:01:11,000
Submit a short clip or one of four original
synthetic scenarios.

15
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,800
The video referee examines sampled frames,
returns a decision and evidence.

16
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:21,400
A human referee always makes the final call.

17
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:26,642
Fallback mode is honest when video was not
analyzed.

18
00:01:26,642 --> 00:01:32,300
Six specialized Microsoft Foundry agents power
commentary, analysis, and review.

19
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:37,500
A .NET API connects those agents to a live
React dashboard.

20
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:43,593
RTMI unites football, personalization,
multi-agent AI, and explainability.

21
00:01:43,593 --> 00:01:47,000
Every moment: personal, explainable,
and reviewable.

22
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,041
RTMI. Thank you.
